), a Meia Maratona tem limite de 3 horas (09h00) e a Mini Maratona de 1h15m (07h30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e obter o regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem exclusivamente atrav\u00e9s do portal oficial da Maratona de Macau (www.macaomarathon.com).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66343,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,31,41],"event_type_2":[1451,1424],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47585","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-macau","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-asia","event_type_2-macau"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-internacional-de-macau-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47585","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=47585"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47585\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65856,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47585\/revisions\/65856"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\